                                                "sense_id": "b8a94938-072b-35e6-8fc0-d429cc44a4e0",
                                                "text": "“Anyone have any nasal spray?” I asked. “Afrin specifically?” Afrin is basically neosynephrine, a potent vasoconstrictor, and would be ideal to put on a tissue stuffed deeply in the nose."
